BuildSite App v.3

a guide to the source tree structure:

db-upgrade/ 
    the database upgrade scripts, assuming an existing 
    buildsite bsdata database as a starting point.
	
lib/
    perl modules
    
script/
    Catalyst-generated helper scripts, including cgi and fastcgi 
    frontends, and a standalone web server (bsa_server.pl).
    
bin/
    command-line utilities. Primarily for testing and debugging 
    individual BST features and the database.
    
templates/
    Application page templates, in Template Toolkit language.
    
root/
    Accessory files for the pages: images, css and javascript.

t/
    testing scripts
    
doc/
    documentation

